# Forge / LLM

- **Grok preset** uses same-origin `POST /api/forge-chat` (server holds `XAI_API_KEY`). Never put xAI keys in the client bundle
- Optional UI session key is `sessionStorage` only; migrate away from long-lived `localStorage` secrets
- Local gateways (Ollama / LM Studio / ForgeRouter): paste base URL with or without `/v1`; use a **real model tag** (e.g. `llama3.2`), never hardcode `model: "default"` for Ollama
- Ollama binds `127.0.0.1` by default — prefer `http://127.0.0.1:11434`, not a LAN IP
- Streaming SSE must flush trailing buffers; map abort timeout vs user cancel distinctly
- LLM failure falls back to templates; persist **last forge** for UI + export (`preferences` / export contract)
